    "description_raw": "You gain an innate sense of the direction to your home or to the place where you last attempted a Craft check, whichever you choose when you cast the spell. You gain a +10 insight bonus on Survival checks made to find your way back to the chosen place.\n\nWhile under the effects of this spell, items in your possession gain a +2 luck bonus on saving throws against spells and effects, and you gain a +5 luck bonus on Craft checks to create or repair objects with Craft skills in which you are trained.",
